 r←Test_IniFiles_05(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;path;cn;rc;log;expected
⍝ Exercise `Run` without any INI file: a single line reports the files searched for
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 path←FilesAndDirs.GetTempSubDir''
 cn←2 ⎕NQ #'GetEnvironment' 'Computername'
 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 #.TEMP.⎕FX'r←Test_01 y;⎕TRAP' 'r←0'
 #.TEMP.T←⎕NEW ##.Tester2 #.TEMP
 #.TEMP.T.IniFolder←path
 (rc log)←#.TEMP.T.Run 1
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 expected←'No INI file found (searched for "',path,'/Testcases.ini" and "',path,'/Testcases-',cn,'.ini")'
 →T.GoToTidyUp~(⊂expected)∊log
 →T.GoToTidyUp∨/'Searching for INI file'⍷∊log

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 FilesAndDirs.RmDir path
